science-platform-images feeds common image package requirements into nb-wrangler
notebooks-repo feeds notebooks, per-notebook requirements.txt, refdata_dependencies.yaml into nb-wrangler
User adds inline package, data, environment, and image requirements into wrangler spec
Optionally User runs nb-wrangler to resolve package constraints and add package and data locks locally
Optionally user builds test image locally to verify spec and image correctness
User adds to nb-wrangler-images on GitHub
nb-wrangler-images flows tooling + spec into GitHub Actions
Curation Action runs nb-wrangler to generate code + data locks before building image
Reinstallation Action feeds unaltered spec into Docker to build pre-locked image
GitHub Actions both flow tooling + spec into Docker to generate notebook/code + spec images
First, Action pushes images to GHCR container registry
Second, Action runs advisory tests on image imports and notebooks
Jupyter Hub TEST spawner discovers and pulls images from GHCR container registry
Curator or pipeline tests image on platform
Tested image is delivered to ECR
Tested image is promoted to PROD
